usually a very bad idea.  Spend that turn finger-engraving Elbereth.

Even if you didn't realize that you can write E in a pit (or have an
E-less conduct), you'd still be better served trying to use that turn
to get out of the pit or something else that might be helpful.  But E
is the best plan, especially since you'll probably get 2 chances to
write it before the q attacks.  Odds are pretty high that it'll work
before you're in mortal peril.



